            "value": {
                "none": [
                    "In the Society, officials decide. Who you love. Where you work. When you die.\n\nCassia has always trusted their choices. It�s hardly any price to pay for a long life, the perfect job, the ideal mate. So when her best friend appears on the Matching screen, Cassia knows with complete certainty that he is the one�until she sees another face flash for an instant before the screen fades to black. Now Cassia is faced with impossible choices: between Xander and Ky, between the only life she�s known and a path no one else has ever dared follow�between perfection and passion.\n\nMatched is a story for right now and storytelling with the resonance of a classic."
                ]
